{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/202694uswKt1t91794872021.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>半山寶珊道有水管滲漏，水務署暫停附近一帶供水維修，到凌晨1時15分恢復供水。</p><p></p><p>水務署安排水箱讓居民取用。涉事的是寶珊道一個電訊公司地盤內的食水管，水務署指，懷疑水管因工程意外受損導致滲漏。</p><p></p><p>水管供應食水範圍包括克頓道5號、寶珊道6號及8號，涉及近200個單位。署方在昨晚10時用水高峰後停水，進行緊急維修，又指已與民政處及區議員等聯繫，為有需要市民提供支援。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T00:45:24.313578+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":179,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T23:09:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T02:17:20.480122+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T00:38:49.438312+00:00","content_hash":"9732282f747993ef9c50bf874ce5e1f06cbea3744481f6b20762409e4eb68bd8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T00:45:24.313578+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}